      "response_raw": "cookie 'token': two independently-issued tokens for this cookie share an identical 543-character prefix, suggesting a predictable/non-random component",
      "evidence_refs": [],
      "description": "Cookie 'token' -- two independently-issued tokens for this cookie share an identical 543-character prefix, suggesting a predictable/non-random component.",
      "recommendation": "Generate session identifiers with a cryptographically secure PRNG carrying at least 64 bits of entropy, with no fixed, sequential, or otherwise predictable component, per the OWASP Session Management Cheat Sheet.",
